flowchart LR
    %% Actors
    User([User])
    ThirdParty([Third-Party Requester])
    System([KYC Vault Backend])

    %% User Actions
    User --> |Uploads ID| UC1(Onboard Identity)
    User --> |Approves Data Request| UC2(Selective Disclosure)
    User --> |1-Click Revocation| UC3(Revoke Consent)
    
    %% System Actions
    UC1 -.-> |Extracts Data| UC4(AI OCR Validation)
    UC4 -.-> |Hashes Data| UC5(Anchor to Ethereum)
    System --> UC4
    System --> UC5
    
    %% Third Party Actions
    ThirdParty --> |Requests Identity Data| UC2
    UC2 -.-> |Triggers| UC6(Grant Access on Smart Contract)
    UC3 -.-> |Triggers| UC7(Wipe Access from Smart Contract)
